/E (Besides proving that the tunnel is secure, the system also needs to show that it can carry real application traffic, similar to a real bank connection. A dummy transaction API was created using FastAPI and deployed on the LTI Server. The API is bound only to the internal tunnel interface \(10.100.0.1:8000\), so it can only be accessed after a bank node successfully completes the WireGuard handshake and establishes the VPN tunnel. Any request made from outside the tunnel will fail because the API is not available on the public network.)
